{"ticker":"MMM","updated":"2026-10-23T23:18:09Z","profile":{"longName":"3M Company","shortName":"3M Company","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Conglomerates","country":"United States","website":"https://www.3m.com","fullTimeEmployees":60500,"marketCap":89457213440,"trailingPE":25.889553,"forwardPE":17.511892,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.5432808,"pegRatio":1.64,"targetMeanPrice":189.98334,"targetHighPrice":230.0,"targetLowPrice":125.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.01,"earningsGrowth":0.697,"grossMargins":0.39533,"operatingMargins":0.23694,"profitMargins":0.14006,"totalRevenue":25247000576,"beta":1.058,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":184.9,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":139.34,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.78},"summary":"3M Company provides diversified technology services in the America, the Asia Pacific, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Safety and Industrial, Transportation and Electronics, and Consumer. The Safety and Industrial segment provides industrial abrasives and finishing for metalworking applications; autobody repair solutions; industrial specialty products, such as personal hygiene products, masking, and packaging materials; electrical products and materials for construction and maintenance, power distribution, and electrical original equipment manufacturers; structural adhesives and tapes; respiratory, hearing, eye, and fall protection solutions; and natural and color-coated mineral granules for shingles. The Transportation and Electronics segment provides ceramic solutions; attachment and bonding, films, sound, and temperature management for transportation vehicles; format graphic films for advertising and fleet signage; reflective signage for highway and vehicle safety; light management films and electronics assembly solutions; chip packaging and interconnection solutions; semiconductor production materials; and data center solutions. The Consumer segment offers cleaning products for the home; consumer air quality products; picture hanging accessories; retail abrasives, paint accessories, and safety products; stationery and","summary_zh":"3M公司在美洲、亞太、歐洲、中東、非洲和國際上提供多元化的技術服務。它透過三個部門運作：安全和工業部門、運輸和電子部門以及消費者部門。安全和工業部門為金屬加工應用提供工業磨料和精加工；汽車車身維修解決方案；工業特種產品，如個人衛生用品、口罩和包裝材料；用於建築和維護、配電以及電氣原始設備製造商的電氣產品和材料；結構粘合劑和膠帶；呼吸、聽力、眼睛和墜落防護解決方案；以及用於木瓦的天然和彩色塗層礦物顆粒。交通和電子部門提供陶瓷解決方案；運輸車輛的附著和黏合、薄膜、聲音和溫度管理；格式化用於廣告和車隊標誌的圖形膠片；用於公路和車輛安全的反光標誌；光管理薄膜和電子組裝解決方案；晶片封裝及互連解決方案；半導體生產材料和資料中心解決方案。消費者部門提供家庭清潔產品；消費者空氣品質產品；圖片懸掛配件；零售磨料、油漆配件和安全產品；文具和","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"企業集團","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":157.59,"h":157.92,"l":155.8,"c":155.85,"v":1606300},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":155.76,"h":156.72,"l":154.58,"c":156.57,"v":2960600},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":156.04,"h":157.22,"l":155.75,"c":156.53,"v":2155000},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":157.76,"h":158.47,"l":156.58,"c":157.56,"v":2982200},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":157.6,"h":158.24,"l":155.32,"c":155.53,"v":3279100},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":153.95,"h":154.49,"l":151.7,"c":154.27,"v":2745100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":153.5,"h":154.09,"l":150.43,"c":152.0,"v":3964400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":152.2,"h":155.6,"l":152.02,"c":155.52,"v":2741200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":155.8,"h":157.56,"l":154.28,"c":155.3,"v":2053300},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":154.61,"h":154.98,"l":152.0,"c":154.0,"v":2715500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":154.15,"h":154.15,"l":151.55,"c":153.08,"v":1669200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":153.16,"h":155.21,"l":152.46,"c":153.57,"v":2811600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":153.79,"h":159.5,"l":153.4,"c":159.47,"v":3663900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":159.11,"h":162.1,"l":157.81,"c":157.87,"v":2865100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":158.0,"h":158.38,"l":155.25,"c":156.66,"v":3219500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":156.9,"h":157.48,"l":153.63,"c":156.5,"v":2208600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":156.5,"h":158.54,"l":153.54,"c":155.16,"v":2757300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":155.15,"h":156.92,"l":154.31,"c":155.4,"v":1795000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":155.91,"h":157.41,"l